In article <216@uucs1.UUCP> rfp@uucs1.UUCP (rfp) writes:

     5) Don't throw that wand of make invisible away! Use it to zap
	floating eyes, to kill them safely.

Zap it on yourself.  You won't be able to get into shops without a
pick-axe or teleportation, but it's worth it.  Basically, once you're
invisible, monsters that are not right next to you will ignore you.  This
allows you to run away from fights to recover without being chased.

